  "disclosure": "The Compass 95/95 method and 65/65 field source matches, and one Graphify BindingModel graph, were inspected before registration. This is known development data, not held-out evaluation.",
  "limitations": [
    "Graphify lacks Compass typed field metadata, so field-name/line candidates are at most declaration-presence evidence and must remain type-unverified.",
    "The source census covers only eight known Java files and does not measure all class members in either repository.",
    "Missing dependency attribution does not affect this JDK syntax-only member census, but source responsibilities and field-access semantics remain outside this comparison.",
    "No classifier, broad superiority, or cross-language conclusion follows from declaration coverage."
  ],
  "method": {
    "candidate": "Require exact repository-relative source file, matching simple name (method display .name() normalized to name; field label exact), compatible node kind/callability and an anchored graph line within the source declaration span. Compass kind method/field; Graphify _callable=true for methods and not true for fields, excluding _callable_class=true. A missing Graphify type tag is not proof of a field, so report field matches as type-unverified.",
    "comparison": "Apply the same source witness set to both stored graphs. Report graph direction, extraction coverage and line-anchor limits; do not equate node presence with relationship correctness or god-object severity.",
    "cut": "No tuning or threshold. Report per-kind source coverage, source-linked ownership and unique per-declaration identities, all cases, ambiguities and unavailable outcomes. Preserve positive-rated test class.",
    "denominator": "Every direct method and field in the frozen independent JDK sourceMembers lists, excluding constructors and nested/inherited/implicit members. Preserve overloads as separate source declarations.",
    "identity": "Report zero, one or multiple candidate IDs per source declaration and every graph ID matched to more than one source declaration. A reused ID cannot give separate overload-identity credit. Do not choose by first label or proximity.",
    "ownership": "Report direct class-to-candidate links separately: Compass contains; Graphify method for methods and any direct contains or field relation for fields. No containment inferred from the file or class span."
  },
